# I-52: One UI 9 TelephonyUI takes the device's default network type from persist.radio.def_network
# (unset = 22, and only a value above 22 offers the 5G modes). The newer libsec-ril writes it; the
# S20+'s A13 vendor RIL publishes the same CSC value only as ro.telephony.default_network, which the
# A13 TelephonyUI read. Copy it across so the network mode list is the one stock A13 showed.
on property:ro.telephony.default_network=*
    setprop persist.radio.def_network ${ro.telephony.default_network}
